WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.444
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:06.396
 I got him.

00:00:06.396 --> 00:00:09.840
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:17.712
[EXPLOSION]

00:00:21.648 --> 00:00:24.784
[SOFT DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:00:25.584 --> 00:00:27.360
Going to move your foot here.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.380
Point your toe this way.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.240
Yes.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.050
Here.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:31.850
OK?

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.456
Mind your elbow.

00:00:38.456 --> 00:00:43.045
[LAUGHS] Good job, Hawkeye.

00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:46.468
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:00:51.536 --> 00:00:52.336
[SCREAMING]

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.760
(OFF-SCREEN) Cooper!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.330
Where are my headphones?

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.270
 Lila?

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.240
Lila?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.115
[BEEPING]

00:01:04.915 --> 00:01:06.895
Lila!

00:01:06.895 --> 00:01:10.360
[SOFT INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC]

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.230
 Yeah, Dad?

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:18.200
 It worked.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.000
It worked.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.479
[SOFT INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC]

00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:25.958
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.790
 Just like Budapest
all over again.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.343
 You and I remember
Budapest very differently.

00:01:37.207 --> 00:01:39.966
You want me to
slow him down, sir?

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.860
Or are you sending in more
guys for him to beat up?

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.855
 I'll let you know.

00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:48.455
 You better call it,
Coulson, because I'm

00:01:48.455 --> 00:01:49.972
starting to root for this guy.

00:01:49.972 --> 00:01:53.136
[SOFT INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC]

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.820
I guess I should have knocked.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.840
 Oh, my God.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.280
What are you doing here?

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.255
 Disappointing my kids.

00:02:04.758 --> 00:02:07.240
We're supposed to
go water skiing.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.229
Cap needs our help.

00:02:08.229 --> 00:02:09.029
Come on.

00:02:09.029 --> 00:02:11.675
[SOFT DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.610
 Clint, can you get him off me?

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.760
 Buckled in?

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:16.560
 Yeah.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.400
 No, I'm good.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.660
I'm good, arrow guy.
Let's go.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:19.715
Let's go!

00:02:19.715 --> 00:02:23.180
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:36.770
 Whatever it takes.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:40.039
[SOFT DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:45.734
 If we don't get that stone,
billions of people stay dead.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.600
 Then I guess we both
know who it's got to be.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.714
 I guess we do.

00:02:53.714 --> 00:02:57.102
[SOFT DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.330
 The city is flying.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:06.090
We're fighting an
army of robots.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.560
And I have a bow and arrow.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:08.610
None of this makes sense.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:09.410
Ahh!

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:14.480
But I'm going back out
there because it's my job.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.280
OK?

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.860
And I can't do my
job and babysit.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:21.030
Doesn't matter what you
did or what you were.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:24.490
If you go out there, you
fight, and you fight to kill.

00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:25.947
Stay in here, you're good.

00:03:25.947 --> 00:03:27.280
I'll send your brother
to come find you.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.625
But if you step out that
door, you are an Avenger.

00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:33.874
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:03:33.874 --> 00:03:37.332
[INTENSE MUSIC]

00:03:46.224 --> 00:03:49.682
[GROANS]

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.060
 Authorities are wondering
if the masked vigilante

00:03:57.060 --> 00:04:00.390
who terrorized the city's
underworld is back.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:05.120
 When I wore this suit, I
made a whole lot of enemies.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.030
 You're Hawkeye!

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:07.527
 Who are you?

00:04:07.527 --> 00:04:08.660
 Some people have
actually called

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.730
me the world's greatest archer.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.200
[RUMBLING]

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.569
 This is too dangerous.

00:04:17.569 --> 00:04:18.369
Definitely not this one.

00:04:18.369 --> 00:04:22.610
You don't have to say
"definitely" like that.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.760
There are arrows more
dangerous than that one?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.110
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

